OL,3,GNEWSAFirst phase of post-16 campus     
OL,4,Acosted at #86m                         
OL,6,FThe first phase of the development of  
OL,7,FGuernsey's post-16 campus has cost     
OL,8,F#86m, the government has disclosed.    
OL,10,FThe first phase of the plans to create 
OL,11,Fthe new sixth form college, Les Ozouets
OL,12,Fcampus, in St Peter Port, are 10 months
OL,13,Ffrom completion, according to Deputy   
OL,14,FPaul Montague, President of Education, 
OL,15,FSport and Culture.                     
OL,17,FHe said the "vast majority" of #86.7m  
OL,18,Fwas being spent at the Les Ozouets site
OL,19,Fbut that included refurbishment work at
OL,20,FLes Varendes High School and digital   
OL,21,Fupgrades at The Guernsey Institute.    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
