OL,3,GNEWSAFirst phase of post-16 campus     
OL,4,Acosted at #86m                         
OL,6,FHe said funding for the second phase   
OL,7,Fhad still not been confirmed so sports 
OL,8,Fstudents would remain at Beau Sejour.  
